    "body": "## Problem\n\nError messages for invalid optional arguments passed to `vim.validate` did not indicate that `nil` was an allowed value.\n\nCloses #40037.\n\n## Solution\n\n- Include `nil` in the expected types for optional arguments.\n- Avoid duplicating `nil` when it is already present in a validator list.\n- Preserve custom validation messages for optional arguments.\n\n## Testing\n\nRan `make functionaltest TEST_FILE=test/functional/lua/vim_spec.lua` — all 130 tests passed.\n",
